 "properties": {
  "description": "Parks, nature reserves, forest preserves / protected areas and woodland in and around Chicago from OpenStreetMap. Feature i is the same in the binary columns and in green-space.geojson. Binary polygons are GeoArrow-style: polygon p (a part) owns rings polygonRingOffsets[p]..[p+1], ring r owns vertices ringOffsets[r]..[r+1]; partFeature maps part -> feature index. green-mask.geojson is one dissolved multipolygon of all green space.",
